{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>She lifts herself on high</b> [תמריא] — She rears up and has no peer. Some say: it is like שור ומריא, and the meaning of מריא is choice fat, in the language of the Rabbis." "<b>She laughs at the horse</b> [תשחק לסוס] — I will pass over [the account of] the swiftness of his running."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 39, :notes {0 "The lemma תמריא does not appear in the Masoretic text of Job 39:18; Ibn Ezra's text appears to reflect a variant reading or a misassigned lemma."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:05:15.282319939Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}